                  "credit": "Wikimedia Commons",
                  "usage_terms": "Creative Commons Attribution 2.0",
                  "description": "This is the Vientaine National Museum. It was very close to closing time, and I still had to grab a spot of lunch and check out two more important landmarks in Vientaine before rushing off to catch my late afternoon flight to Luang Prabang. And most importantly, I was rather low on local currency and had to find a bank to change my USD into Laotian Kip. Two banks in downtown Vientaine had turned me down. So that needed to be sorted out. So purely due to time constraints, and due to the importance of finding an exchange house, I decided to pass. This is a view of the Vientaine museum exterior. We parked the car here and grabbed a quick lunch at a pizza place opposite. (Vientaine, Laos/ Lao PDR, April 2014)"
